# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Internal team artifacts (NEVER commit — not part of the open-source KB)
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Internal workflow / hand-over / SOP files for the maintainer team.
# These must NEVER enter this public repo. Keep them under your home
# Hermes workspace instead:
#   ~/.hermes/sop/              (project SOPs / workflows)
#   ~/.hermes/notes/<project>/  (hand-over notes, outside any project repo)
#
# Examples seen in this repo's history (must stay ignored):
#   .sop-v1.md
#   .handoff-to-nova.md
/.sop*.md
/.handoff*.md
